NJS -> nginx: forward OK res with data
nginx -> Browser: forward resp
Browser -> Practitioner: display requested patient data 
NJS -> AuditLog : Log data 
' note right of AuditLog: access{PractitionerId, patientId, timestamp, consentId}



@enduml